{"type":"message","id":"fa3976fe","parentId":"17d5b201","timestamp":"2026-03-05T13:03:29.614Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_Td55sa6A5SOYANi7PanlOlJM|fc_016cd7ee94e7b1620169a97f20f63881918adc18ffa972fe31","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"}\r\n\r\n# ── Step 6: 重启 Gateway ────────────────────────────────────\r\nrestart_gateway() {\r\n  info \"重启 OpenClaw Gateway...\"\r\n  if openclaw gateway restart 2>/dev/null; then\r\n    log \"Gateway 重启成功\"\r\n  else\r\n    warn \"Gateway 重启失败，请手动重启：openclaw gateway restart\"\r\n  fi\r\n}\r\n\r\n# ── Main ────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\nbanner\r\ncheck_deps\r\nbackup_existing\r\ncreate_workspaces\r\nregister_agents\r\ninit_data\r\nbuild_frontend\r\nfirst_sync\r\nrestart_gateway\r\n\r\necho \"\"\r\necho -e \"${GREEN}╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════╗${NC}\"\r\necho -e \"${GREEN}║  🎉  三省六部安装完成！                          ║${NC}\"\r\necho -e \"${GREEN}╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════╝${NC}\"\r\necho \"\"\r\necho \"下一步：\"\r\necho \"  1. 启动数据刷新循环:  bash scripts/run_loop.sh &\"\r\necho \"  2. 启动看板服务器:    python3 dashboard/server.py\"\r\necho \"  3. 打开看板:          http://127.0.0.1:7891\"\r\necho \"\"\r\ninfo \"文档: docs/getting-started.md\"\r\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772715809612}}
