lYMQeNJ8gEi7suUFrJAlutytwbmy1irKrqPWXNwiLDBfCxgf_fdz7aKbGFNecIA3fEHPVvjteVZ6whvzlfcieVpYjr-oD-upLADvQMwCFCNy0K8-BZ4McNDcu0w=\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Preparing user login instructions**\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]已帮你配到这一步：\n\n- ✅ 已安装 Tailscale（家里这台）\n- ✅ 看板已改成远程可访问监听：`0.0.0.0:7891`\n- ⚠️ 防火墙放行失败（当前会话不是管理员权限）\n\n现在你只要做这几步就能从公司访问：\n\n1. **先在家里电脑登录 Tailscale**  \n   打开这个链接完成登录：  \n   `https://login.tailscale.com/a/a36139201aed8`\n\n2. **在公司电脑安装并登录同一个 Tailscale 账号**\n\n3. **家里电脑用管理员 PowerShell 执行一条防火墙命令**（必须）  \n   ```powershell\n   netsh advfirewall firewall add rule name=\"edict-dashboard-7891\" dir=in action=allow protocol=TCP localport=7891 profile=private\n   ```\n\n4. **登录后查家里电脑的 Tailscale IP**  \n   ```powershell\n   \"C:\\Program Files\\Tailscale\\tailscale.exe\" ip -4\n   ```\n   然后在公司浏览器访问：  \n   `http://<这个IP>:7891`\n\n如果你愿意，我等你完成第 1 步后，继续帮你做“最后验收”（我来检查连通性并给你最终可访问地址）。","textSignature":"msg_016cd7ee94e7b1620169a98247c8bc819188ad8eaa79b5d1cb"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":172,"output":456,"cacheRead":56960,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":57588,"cost":{"input":0.000301,"output":0.006384,"cacheRead":0.009968,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.016653}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772716608278}}
