ort=7891 profile=private\n   ```\n\n3. **家里电脑和其他设备都登录同一个 Tailscale 账号**\n\n4. **在家里电脑查 Tailscale IP**\n   ```powershell\n   \"C:\\Program Files\\Tailscale\\tailscale.exe\" ip -4\n   ```\n\n5. **其他设备浏览器打开**\n   - `http://<家里电脑Tailscale_IP>:7891`\n\n---\n\n如果你只想局域网访问（同一 Wi‑Fi），也可以直接用 `http://家里电脑局域网IP:7891`。  \n但你“在外面也要看”的话，还是 Tailscale 最省事最安全。","textSignature":"msg_016cd7ee94e7b1620169a9917cf5d081919a3cbc0706adbd88"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":1458,"output":365,"cacheRead":127488,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":129311,"cost":{"input":0.0025515,"output":0.00511,"cacheRead":0.022310399999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.029971899999999996}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772720503579}}
